            "review_title": "Review at Restaurant Binh 86",
            "review_text": "Chris B\nHolyhead, United Kingdom632 contributions\n0\nLocals restaurant\nApr 2024 • Couples\nWe came here as it was close to the airport classic hotel that we stayed in the night before returning to UK. it is a family run restaurant and very popular with the locals. It serves cheap draught beer which was very good. The staff found a couple of westerners in the restaurant quite amusing I think judging by the looks we were getting, but they also were very pleasant and did their best to look after us. The menu is also for locals with dishes that you will not see in the tourist areas of Vietnam, chickens feet, toad and bile secretion to name but a few. There were more usual dishes too, we had a chicken dish and some rice and chips which were good. I should add that the prices were extremely cheap\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 3, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
