            "review_title": "Review at Restaurant Binh 86",
            "review_text": "J and E M\nWalnut Creek, Ohio15 contributions\n0\nBasic meal\nMar 2024 • Couples\nWe were expecting a restaurant with pizza and fruit smoothies per another review, so perhaps that review belongs elsewhere since they serve neither. Extensive menu, almost too many choices. Once we were there we couldn’t leave with so few other choices around the airport. There were lots of locals by the time we left and it seemed like a popular place for draft beer. We enjoyed the grilled shrimp with chili although not much flavor on its own. Nice to have an English menu and Google translate helped. Friendly staff but not one of our better meals in the past three weeks in Vietnam.\nRead more\nWritten March 10, 2024",
