            "review_title": "Review at Restaurant Binh 86",
            "review_text": "StephenNorthernNV\nNorthern NV116 contributions\n0\nNeighborhood gem\nApr 2023 • Couples\nThis restaurant was suggested by our hotel, Airport Classic Hotel, which was nearby. I had the grilled shrimp with salt and chili, which was delicious. My wife had roasted chicken with ginger, which was good but my shrimp was better. I drank draft beer that was tasty and very cold. The staff was very attentive and friendly, and the prices were very reasonable. We ate quite early and by the time we were finished, many locals were there. Give it a try!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten April 4, 2023",
